pycparser-rust: Rust port of eliben/pycparser
https://github.com/eliben/pycparser
Upstream authors: Eli Bendersky <eliben@gmail.com>
Upstream license: BSD-3-Clause

This is a clean-room Rust implementation of the pycparser C parser API.
It incorporates no code from the upstream project; behavior, message texts,
and the AST shape are modelled on pycparser 3.12 for drop-in compatibility.

